# Optional. Without this, the generator calls the GitHub API unauthenticated
# (60 requests/hour, shared across your whole network — easy to exhaust).
# A classic token with no scopes (public read access only) is enough:
# https://github.com/settings/tokens -> Generate new token (classic) -> no scopes checked.
#
# Never commit a real token. This file is a template only; the real
# .env is gitignored.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
